                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Crafted from heavyweight 460 GSM 100% cotton and finished with a vintage wash for that perfectly worn-in feel, this oversized hoodie is built to stand out in every direction. The front keeps it clean and controlled with a bold plastered graphic, delivering a strong but minimal statement. Turn it around and everything shifts. The back goes full intensity with an insanity design that dominates the piece and demands attention. Finished with an oversized, relaxed fit for maximum drape and comfort, this is heavyweight streetwear made to hit different from every angle.</p>",
